The files shipped by this package are proprietary binaries extracted verbatim
from the vendor firmware image distributed with the Spectrum SBE1V1K
(QSDK14, package sbe-full-candidate version 23).

    lib/firmware/ath12k/QCN9274/hw2.0/firmware-2.bin
    lib/firmware/ath12k/QCN9274/hw2.0/board-2.bin
    lib/firmware/ath12k/QCN9274/hw2.0/regdb.bin
    usr/share/sbe-wifi/bdf41/b1.bin
    usr/share/sbe-wifi/bdf41/b2.bin
    usr/share/sbe-wifi/bdf41/b4.bin

The vendor image stores these under ath12k/QCN92XX/hw1.0/; they are
byte-identical here and only the directory name follows the upstream
ath12k hw table ("qcn9274 hw2.0" -> QCN9274/hw2.0).

Per-device calibration data (cal-pci-<domain:bus:dev.fn>.bin) is NOT part of
this package.  The vendor image only contains symlinks into /tmp/sbe-caldata,
recreated at boot from the eMMC "0:ART" partition; those blobs are specific to
each unit and were not present in the extracted rootfs.

Their redistribution terms have not been reviewed.  This package exists only
for local, self-built use on hardware the owner possesses (project decision
N-3).  Do not redistribute any image built with it until the license review
is complete.  Per-file SHA-256 sums are in files/FILES-SHA256.
